---
source: src/tui/view.rs
expression: "rows.join(\"\\n\")"
---
 ?   dashb┌LEGEND───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ · 12:34:56
┌SESSIONS─│ ↑           served on a newer model: bright on the latest turn, dim earlier │──────────┐
│session  │ $           released past the armed quota gate for this window              │  out idle│
│ses-free │ %           released to the end of the plan, stopping before overage        │   60   1m│
│ses-hot  │ !           stopped: the last thing this session got was a gate notice      │2,304   1m│
│… 2 more │ ↺           compactions so far; - for none                                  │          │
└─────────│ -           not reported, which is not zero                                 │──────────┘
┌CONTEXT──│ ?           unknown: model, context ceiling, or token count                 │──────────┐
│ses-free │ ≥           a floor: some rows unknown, or the span predates the data       │          │
│ses-hot  │ <1%         spent less than the meter's 1% step shows; 0% is none at all    │          │
│… 2 more │ ·           no requests in that slice of the window; red holds an error     │          │
└─────────│ ‹N          N accounts hidden to the left of the meters shown               │──────────┘
┌TOKENS───│ … N more    N accounts hidden to the right                                  │──────────┐
│fresh inp│ on track    the meter resets before it runs out                             │          │
│cache rea│ estimating  too little data to separate burn from noise                     │          │
│cache wri│ stops ~T    reaches the armed gate's threshold at T                         │          │
│cache wri│ out ~T      runs out at T                                                   │          │
│output   │ gated ·     past the gate; the countdown is to exhaustion                   │          │
│hit rate │ on track?   a trailing ?: the gate's state is assumed, not observed         │e prefix  │
│missed   │ last req    green under 30s, yellow under 5m, red beyond                    │          │
└─────────│ ctx         green: native 1M; yellow: another known ceiling                 │──────────┘
┌CACHE REB│ idle        dim once a session has been quiet 3m                            │──────────┐
│2 of 9 re│ KEYS                                                                        │          │
│system pr│ click       open a session's detail                                         │          │
│new prefi│ wheel       scroll the list under the pointer                               │          │
│· ses-hot│ ←/→ h/l     scroll the accounts in rate & quota                             │          │
└─────────│ r           refresh now                                                     │──────────┘
┌RATE & QU│ q           quit                                                            │──────────┐
│  request└? or esc close───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘          │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
